# MuScriptor transcription work

Before implementing audio → MIDI features, read:

1. `docs/MUSCRIPTOR-REFERENCE.md` — API, models, instrument groups
2. `docs/MUSCRIPTOR-INTEGRATION-PLAN.md` — phased rollout, sidecar design
3. `../midi classifier/docs/LOCAL-PATCHES.md` on branch `local/butter-reference` — validated decoder fixes

ROADMAP #17 is transcription (MuScriptor). ROADMAP #14 is MIDI keyboard input — different feature.

Decoder patches in `muscriptor/events.py` are required for correct note output; do not depend on unpatched upstream for transcription.
